&lt;p&gt;NuGet: &lt;a href="https://www.nuget.org/packages/OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Geneva/1.15.1" rel="nofollow"&gt;OpenTelemetry.Exporter.Geneva v1.15.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
